WHAT THIS LICENCE DOES NOT COVER

These books compile, grade and cite other people's research. They quote no
source text. The findings, figures and datasets they describe remain the work
of the investigators named in each bibliography, under whatever terms those
works carry. This licence covers the compilation, the writing, the grading and
the original diagrams — not the underlying studies.

Where a figure carries a licence of its own, that licence is stated in the
figure's own entry and in images/CREDITS.md, and it governs that figure.
